---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Credits That Count: Will this credit count?"
  description="Louisiana credit transfer checks, full transfer plans, and signed audits, built from official published sources. Match your credits. Know what transfers."
>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <p class="hero-state">Louisiana</p>
      <h1>Will this credit count?</h1>
      <p class="hero-tag">Match your credits. Know what transfers.</p>
      <p class="lede">
        Credits That Count turns Louisiana's published transfer rules into a
        personal plan for one student, built from official sources and stamped
        with the date and edition it was prepared from.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="/checker/">Check My Credits, Free</a>
        <a class="btn secondary" href="/pricing/">See Plans and Pricing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <section class="block">
      <div class="pathgrid">
        <a class="pathbox" href="/checker/">
          <span class="pathbox-title">Check My Credits</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">See which of your courses count at the college you choose.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="pathbox" href="/pricing/">
          <span class="pathbox-title">Get the Full Plan</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">A semester by semester transfer plan with deadlines and next steps.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="pathbox" href="/pricing/">
          <span class="pathbox-title">Signed Audit</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">The full plan, personally reviewed and signed by a Credit Transfer Pro.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="pathbox" href="/counselors/">
          <span class="pathbox-title">For Counselors</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">Plans and audits for every student on your roster.</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Guidance you can verify, line by line</h2>
      <p>
        Every answer is built from official published sources: the Louisiana
        Board of Regents Course Articulation Matrix, the statewide common
        course catalog, college catalogs, published admission standards, and
        published tuition schedules, each dated and edition stamped on the
        plan itself.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is guidance, not an official ruling. Only the receiving college
        makes the final decision on how a credit applies, and requirements
        can change. A plan states what the published sources said on the date
        it was prepared, and names its sources so a family can verify every
        line with the college.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Start free. Go deeper when you are ready.</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Free Checker</h3>
          <p class="price">$0</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Course by course verdicts for covered Louisiana colleges</li>
            <li>Compare two colleges side by side</li>
            <li>Pathways, eligibility, and admission checks</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn" href="/checker/">Start Checking</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card featured">
          <h3>Full Plan</h3>
          <p class="price">$79 <small>one time</small></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Semester by semester Louisiana Transfer Degree plan</li>
            <li>Admission standing and AP outcomes</li>
            <li>Savings estimate and application packet with deadlines</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn" href="/pricing/">See the Full Plan</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Signed Audit</h3>
          <p class="price">$199 <small>one time</small></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in the Full Plan</li>
            <li>Personally reviewed against the published sources</li>
            <li>Signed by a Credit Transfer Pro</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn" href="/pricing/">See the Signed Audit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="fine" style="margin-top:14px;">
        Delivered in 48 hours or less. Louisiana is the first state we serve.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="tagline-foot">Know before you go.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
